  "excerpt": "",
  "content": "<div class=\"entry-header\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title event-entry-title course-entry-title\">NEPs Focus on Higher Education</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"entry-blog single-course-content\">\n<div class=\"entry-summary clearfix\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\">\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Organizing Department Name: Institutions Innovation Council (IIC)</strong>\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Title of the event: </strong>NEPs Focus on Governance, Leadership, Innovation, Entrepreneurship in Higher Education\n\n<strong>Date: 29-12-2020</strong>\n\n<strong>Venue: Through MS Teams</strong>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Event Description: </strong>ATME College of Engineering, Mysuru has organized a webinar on the topic “NEPs Focus on Governance, Leadership, Innovation, Entrepreneurship in Higher Education” in association with Institutions Innovation Council on 29<sup>th</sup> December 2020. Dr. Kalpana Gopalan, IAS, PhD-IIMB, Additional Chief Secretary, Department of Youth Empowerment &amp; Sports, Government of Karnataka addressed the students and faculties on application of National Education Policy to the fields of  Governance, Leadership, Innovation and Entrepreneurship in Higher Education Institutions.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://old.atme.edu.in/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/NEP-2020-Workshop-Report.pdf\"><strong>Report</strong></a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
